-- bar, a body QR, and a Code 128 barcode on the stub. Every template keeps the
-- mandatory secure QR on the front, so the front-QR constraint still holds.
-- Only system rows (created_by IS NULL) are written; workspace templates and
-- workspace overrides are left untouched.

